{
 "format": 1,
 "about": "The AE concussion rifle pack (folder concussion_rifle): ZTeam's arc launcher (the ZTeam tag pack's concussion_rifle/hr: its weapon, third-person and first-person models, shaders, bitmaps, first-person animations (from its hr_cad folder), collision, sounds, explosive bolt with its effects, and its launcher HUD) as an Xbox weapon tuned for displacement and splash: 6 bolts a magazine at 2 a second, each bolt a 1.5-unit blast of 30 at the centre falling to 10 at the edge that throws players and vehicles. Everything the stock weapons have that it uses (materials, melee, drop and pickup sounds, the rounds panel) is the map's. make_pack.py runs it; the locations of the zip, the stock map and the programs are given on its command line (--zip).",
